note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/lib-pu.om: test scaffolding, OM-1 words only. Every program-mode
note fixture of this directory is compiled as FIXTURE+lib-pu.om (the gate's a+b concatenation), so
note the fixture's own line numbers are unchanged. pu v writes v in decimal and one LF to stdout.
fn pu v ulong to void
b = new uchar 21 10
x = v
p = ulong 20
go = true
while go
p = sub p 1
put b p uchar add 48 rem x 10
x = div x 10
if eq x 0
go = false
end
end
r = write 1 b p sub 21 p
end
